{"post": true, "caption": "A loss is a cost of doing business. The trade you take right after it, angry, is where the real damage starts.\nRevenge trades skip your checklist: no setup, no stop, bigger size.\nSet a rule before you need it: after a loss that stings, close the charts and come back tomorrow.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingPsychology #RevengeTrading #TradingDiscipline #TradingPH", "tag": "// mindset.exe", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 140, "lines": [{"t": "YOUR LOSS", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "ISN'T THE", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "PROBLEM.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "lines": [{"t": "It's the next trade.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "The angry one.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "code", "dur": 5.0, "lines": [{"t": "while (angry) {", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "  trade(size * 2);", "c": "red"}, {"t": "}", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "// BUG: infinite loop", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "lines": [{"t": "No setup. No stop.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Just \"babawi ako.\"", "c": "fg"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "lines": [{"t": "Not trading.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "It's pure ego.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.6, "lines": [{"t": "The market owes", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "you nothing.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Walk away.", "c": "green"}, {"t": "Come back sharp.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "code", "dur": 4.6, "lines": [{"t": "if (loss && angry) {", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "  close_charts();", "c": "green"}, {"t": "  return wait();", "c": "green"}, {"t": "}", "c": "fg"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "// trade with a system, not a feeling"}]}